<title>JAPAN: Japan MOF likely to offer 6-yr JGBs on Fri - sources.</title>
<headline>Japan MOF likely to offer 6-yr JGBs on Fri - sources.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-01-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Japan's Ministry of Finance (MOF) is likely to hold an auction of six-year Japanese government bonds (JGBs) on Friday, market sources said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>The amount of the offer was likely to be around 500 billion yen, bond traders said.</p>
<p>-- Tokyo Treasury Desk +81-3-3432-9780</p>
</text>
